     off reads before doing so. Leads with the case for appointing this candidate, then the
     commitments made on the strength of it — offer, contract, payroll. It carries no approval
     section, because the approval is the sign-off on the stage this document belongs to. See
     definition.yaml.

     Payroll's rework section is `?` and suppresses entirely on a hire where validation passed
     first time, which is the outcome this process is aiming for and, per the source model, not
     the common one. */
%>
